[statement]
A name whose one candidate needs the carried name is not decided first
where a candidate of another pending name depends on it: `x2`, whose one
candidate `px` needs `dep`, is needed by `kw`, the one candidate for `w`.
`px` is not installed before `v` is decided, though it provides `v`, and
`gk` is installed. Contrast `a-real-dependency-two-provided-names-down-does-not-reach-up`.

[repository]
P:app
V:1
D:v w x2

P:kw
V:1
D:x2
p:w=1

P:px
V:1
D:dep
p:x2=1 v

P:dep
V:1

P:gk
V:1
k:100
p:v

[request]
app

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install gk 1
install dep 1
install px 1
install kw 1
install app 1
